t_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-59ef04e69a144793a7496d584617c58e:11","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-59ef04e69a144793a7496d584617c58e:12","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-59ef04e69a144793a7496d584617c58e:13","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-59ef04e69a144793a7496d584617c58e:14","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","question_text":"抖音达人分销是什么意思？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-12","repeat_index":2,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":15,"valid_url_cards":9,"unique_url_events":8,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"793c3b479f95a4820afea7c5a4705594364acb97f72815524046cd44e267fb14","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":true,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅抖音达人分销（大白话）\n**就是商家把商品放进【精选联盟】，设置佣金，抖音达人（博主/主播）通过短视频、直播间挂商品链接帮商家卖货；成交之后，达人拿佣金提成，商家负责发货、售后，没出单不用给达人钱**。\n> 核心平台：**精选联盟**，是抖音官方的达人分销系统\n\n## 两方角色\n1. **商家（抖店）**\n商品上架到精选联盟，设置佣金比例；谁卖出去，就给谁结算佣金。**零成交零成本**，货、物流、售后全部商家承担。\n2. **达人（创作者）**\n不用囤货、不用发货。选联盟里的商品，拍短视频或者直播带货，有人下单，就赚佣金。\n\n## 特点\n- 结算模式：**CPS按成交付费**，卖出才结算佣金\n- 带货形式：短视频挂车、直播间小黄车\n- 达人不限粉丝大小：大主播、中小达人、普通KOC都可以参与\n- 商家优势：快速铺大量达人渠道，扩大曝光，测试爆款，不用自己做直播流量\n\n## 和【自播】区别\n- **自播**：商家自己账号直播卖货，利润全留自己，但要自己投流量、人力\n- **达人分销**：达人账号帮你卖，分佣金；商家不用自己做内容和直播，但是要让出一部分利润作为佣金\n\n## 举个例子\n商家一款水杯售价39元，设置**20%佣金**。达人视频挂链接，卖出1单，达人赚7.8元，剩下货款归商家，商家负责发货售后。\n\n\n\n要不要我顺便讲下达人分销的佣金规则、结算时间和常见坑？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-59a84badf1114ee498ec365ab2150319:1","title":"抖音电商-学习中心","raw_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aJY4A5G2d3Fo?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aJY4A5G2d3Fo?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","host":"school.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-59a84badf1114ee498ec365ab2150319:2","title":"达人合作入门必修课","raw_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/course-series/cJRcGkcZLVd4?biz_from=talent_cooperation&btm_ppre=a0.b0.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b4369.c0.d0&btm_show_id=4d99d9a2-3ee6-45d9-b5a5-342d12d6df05","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/course-series/cJRcGkcZLVd4?biz_from=talent_cooperation&btm_ppre=a0.b0.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b4369.c0.d0&btm_show_id=4d99d9a2-3ee6-45d9-b5a5-342d12d6df05","host":"school.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-59a84badf1114ee498ec365ab2150319:3","title":"直播带货和达人分销的区别在哪里#直播运营 #直播卖货 #达人分销带货 #广州直播代播 #广州直播代运营","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7683100896616432531","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7683100896616432531","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"