share/video/7627435711834263973","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7627435711834263973","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-dc32f318561942169a2a5aabaa399955:9","title":"什么是达人分销？#电商 #达人分销 #双十一 #直播带货 #短视频带货","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7569160988379153894","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7569160988379153894","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-dc32f318561942169a2a5aabaa399955:10","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-dc32f318561942169a2a5aabaa399955:11","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-dc32f318561942169a2a5aabaa399955:12","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-dc32f318561942169a2a5aabaa399955:13","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-dc32f318561942169a2a5aabaa399955:14","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-dc32f318561942169a2a5aabaa399955:15","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","question_text":"抖音达人分销是什么意思？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":15,"valid_url_cards":9,"unique_url_events":8,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"a11e7167ffb8b9666abd486b2edd6dfb06c6f0db66a170132b7a106a929cd062","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":true,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅ 抖音达人分销（大白话）\n**达人分销 = 商家把商品上架【精选联盟】，设置佣金，抖音达人（博主/主播/KOC）通过短视频、直播间挂商品链接帮商家卖货；卖出一单，达人拿一单佣金，没成交不用给达人付费（按成交效果结算）**\n\n> 核心载体：**精选联盟**，是抖音电商官方分销平台\n\n## 双方分工\n- **商家（抖店）**：把商品放进精选联盟，设置佣金比例；负责发货、售后、库存；达人出单后自动结算佣金。\n- **达人**：不用囤货、不用发货。拍短视频或者直播带货，挂商品小黄车；有人下单收货后，达人赚取佣金提成。\n\n## 特点\n1. **零预付成本**：不出单，商家不用花钱；属于效果付费模式。\n2. **达人量级广**：可以是头部主播，也可以是几千粉丝的中小KOC，大量达人一起铺内容，批量带货。\n3. **和自播区别**：自播是商家自己账号直播卖货；达人分销是借用别人达人账号流量带货。\n\n## 举个例子\n你是商家，一款杯子卖39元，设置**20%佣金**。达人发视频挂杯子链接，用户下单确认收货后，达人拿到7.8元佣金，剩下货款归你，你负责发货。\n\n## 补充\n很多商家会搭配**招商团长**来批量邀约大量达人，快速铺达人分销渠道。\n\n\n如果你想，我可以分开讲：**商家怎么开通达人分销** / **达人怎么加入分销带货赚佣金**。","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-864569a353604181a30314d194b87c00:1","title":"抖音电商-学习中心","raw_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aJY4A5G2d3Fo?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aJY4A5G2d3Fo?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","host":"school.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_sta