27435711834263973","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7627435711834263973","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-864569a353604181a30314d194b87c00:10","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-864569a353604181a30314d194b87c00:11","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-864569a353604181a30314d194b87c00:12","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-864569a353604181a30314d194b87c00:13","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-864569a353604181a30314d194b87c00:14","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-864569a353604181a30314d194b87c00:15","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","question_text":"抖音达人分销是什么意思？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":2,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":18,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":10,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"1980e2eaca6c47d8d301b385c9cd0d69f7bfb098ee7d3b2feebd7e558228daea","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":true,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅ 抖音达人分销（大白话）\n**就是商家把商品放到【精选联盟】，设置佣金，让抖音达人（博主/主播）通过短视频、直播帮你卖货；达人卖出一单拿一单提成，没出单商家不用花钱**，属于**按效果付费**的带货模式。\n\n> 平台底层工具：**精选联盟**，这就是抖音达人分销的载体\n\n## 各方分工\n1. **商家（抖店）**：上架商品、设置佣金比例、发货、售后；商品加入精选联盟，达人就能看到。\n2. **达人**：在精选联盟选品，视频/直播间挂车推广；用户通过达人链接下单，订单完成后拿**佣金（平台扣10%技术服务费）**。\n3. **平台**：负责订单追踪、分佣结算。\n\n## 两种推广形式\n- 短视频分销：达人拍种草视频，视频挂购物车\n- 直播分销：直播间讲解、弹窗挂车带货\n\n## 和“坑位费直播”的区别\n- ✅ **达人分销（精选联盟）**：大多**无坑位费**，只按成交算佣金，出单才给钱，风险低；适合铺大量中小达人、KOC。\n- ❌ 头部专场直播：很多要**坑位费+佣金**，不管卖不卖，先付一笔固定费用，成本更高。\n\n## 适合谁\n- 商家：想快速铺渠道、测爆款，不想只靠自己直播间卖货\n- 达人：不用囤货、发货，只做内容推广赚佣金\n\n## 简单例子\n一件产品售价100元，商家设置20%佣金。达人带货卖出1件：\n- 用户付100元\n- 商家收到货款（减去平台扣点+20元佣金）\n- 达人拿到20元佣金（平台再扣10%技术服务费）\n\n\n\n如果你想，我可以分别给你讲：**商家怎么做达人分销**，或者**达人怎么靠分销带货赚佣金**。","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-f2715db4f36e4ea2a77b08f2a6272b50:1","title":"抖音电商-学习中心","raw_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aJY4A5G2d3Fo?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aJY4A5G2d3Fo?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","host":"school.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-f2715db4f36e4ea2a77b08f2a6272b50:2","title":"达人合作入门必修课","raw_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/course-series/cJRcGkcZLVd4?biz_from=talent_cooperation&btm_ppre=a0.b0.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b4369.c0