选联盟主流）\n- **坑位费合作**：除佣金外，达人开播前还要收一笔固定坑位费，不管卖不卖货都要付，不属于分销。\n\n## 补充\n达人分销不只是大主播，大量中小达人、素人KOC一起铺短视频，也是达人分销，很多店铺靠海量达人短视频种草出单。\n","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-b276f1347f6b43fe9262ee6efc3b27d8:1","title":"抖音电商-学习中心","raw_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aJY4A5G2d3Fo?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aJY4A5G2d3Fo?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","host":"school.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-b276f1347f6b43fe9262ee6efc3b27d8:2","title":"达人合作入门必修课","raw_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/course-series/cJRcGkcZLVd4?biz_from=talent_cooperation&btm_ppre=a0.b0.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b4369.c0.d0&btm_show_id=4d99d9a2-3ee6-45d9-b5a5-342d12d6df05","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/course-series/cJRcGkcZLVd4?biz_from=talent_cooperation&btm_ppre=a0.b0.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b4369.c0.d0&btm_show_id=4d99d9a2-3ee6-45d9-b5a5-342d12d6df05","host":"school.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-b276f1347f6b43fe9262ee6efc3b27d8:3","title":"直播带货和达人分销的区别在哪里#直播运营 #直播卖货 #达人分销带货 #广州直播代播 #广州直播代运营","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7683100896616432531","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7683100896616432531","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0024","question_id":"CQ-Q0024","citation_id":"smp-b276f1347f6b43fe9262ee6efc3b27d8:4","title":"什么是达人分销？#电商 #达人分销 #双十一 #直播带货 #短视频带货"